-Phase 6: Check the processes of the victim's machine. It shows how using 'wevutils.exe' they unninstalled microsoft antivirus Windows Defender, Real Time Protection and the Antimalware. 
The next step that the attacker did was installing another version of Microsoft Defender and DLL's. 


-Phase 7: As wevutils.exe is considered High Privilege action. Probably the machine didn't have Admin account or the victim was using the Admin account for a short period of time and at the 
same time downloaded the malware, which gave full access to the attacker. 





